# Only specs/, plans/ and decisions/ are committed from this directory, plus the dated
# eval-evidence notes and the history-rewrite map this repository keeps at
# the top level (CLAUDE.md, "Planning and Spec Docs Are Tracked Here").
# Run artifacts belong in hyperpowers-evals under evals/evidence/.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/specs/
!/plans/
!/decisions/
!/*.md
!/*.tsv
